  <div class="biz-card"><span aria-hidden="true">📍</span><h3>A listing in the guide</h3><p>Your place appears in the Hakolah guide with map, hours and phone, found by people searching your name or your kind of food.</p></div>
</div>
<p class="biz-note">Transparency: any place that pays to be featured is clearly labelled "Ad", and doesn't rise in search or in "Pick for me" because of it.</p>
